---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About Spickle | Stone Cleaning & Sealing Melbourne"
  description="Spickle cleans and seals natural stone and concrete across Melbourne and the Mornington Peninsula, matching the treatment to the stone."
>
  <section class="band hairline-top">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <div>
        <h1>Stone people, not pressure-washer people</h1>
        <p class="lede">Spickle does one thing: cleaning and sealing natural stone and concrete, across Melbourne and the Mornington Peninsula.</p>
        <p>Every stone takes cleaners and sealers differently. A product that's routine on granite can permanently etch limestone, and a sealer that suits dense bluestone can peel off slate. Matching the treatment to the stone is the whole job, and it's what we know.</p>
        <p>We work for homeowners, property managers, body corporates and golf clubs, and we seal new jobs for landscapers and builders before handover.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="facts">
        <div class="todo">[Who does the work: names, photo, background. Waiting on content from Lukey.]</div>
        <div class="todo">[ABN and insurance details to add]</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band panel">
    <div class="wrap book-row">
      <div>
        <h2>Talk to us about your stone</h2>
        <p>Photos and a rough size are all we need to price it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/book-now">Book a quote</a>
        <a class="tlink" href="tel:1300220045">Call 1300 22 00 45</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem); align-items: start; }
  .lede { font-size: var(--step-1); color: #d6e8ee; }
  .facts { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .book-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem 3rem; }
  .book-row h2 { margin-bottom: 0.3em; }
  .book-row p { margin: 0; }
  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.9rem 1.6rem; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
